  "body": "Hi, I found this pull-request which is already merged into the synapse version I am using on my homeserver: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/7908\r\n\r\nWhat is the API endpoint to send the request to? It's pretty urgent as I accidentally deactivated my main-account on my homeserver while playing around with my API shellscripts. I still have another admin account to send the \"reactivate-request\" to the API though.\r\n\r\nI tried curls against endpoint addresses like this but no luck so far. Couldn't find it in the code either....didn't search extensively though....\r\n\r\nhttps://my-hs.fqdn/_matrix/client/r0/admin/activate/%40${USER}%3Amy-hs.fqdn?access_token=${TOKEN}\"\r\n\r\nhttps://my-hs.fqdn/_matrix/client/r0/admin/reactivate/%40${USER}%3Amy-hs.fqdn?access_token=${TOKEN}\"\r\n\r\n\r\nPS: Sorry for cross-posting (I sent to the original pull-request as well but then figured that probably it might not be the right place to ask questions like \"how to use this new feature?\"",
